- The team discussed potential revisions to remote work policies, including clearer guidelines on availability during work hours, expectations for in-person attendance for team projects, and enhanced support for remote technology.  
- Emily will draft recommendations for optimizing remote work policies, drawing from employee feedback and best practices from industry leaders, to be shared in the next meeting.

